== SP-06 Deliver ==
ROLE_SUPPLIER -> B_SP_06 : Delivery receipt and invoice of the supplier
B_SP_06 -> C_person_ROLE_SUPPLIER : Deliver
C_person_ROLE_SUPPLIER -> E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN : use: Contract or purchase order in force
C_person_ROLE_SUPPLIER -> E_S_DELIVERED : write: Delivery made, with delivery receipt and invoice
== SP-07 Inspect and accept ==
ROLE_INSPECTOR -> B_SP_07 : Paper form: inspection and acceptance report
B_SP_07 -> C_person_ROLE_INSPECTOR : Inspect and accept
note right of C_person_ROLE_INSPECTOR : R-ACCEPT: Inspection and acceptance by two different signers
C_person_ROLE_INSPECTOR -> E_S_DELIVERED : use: Delivery made, with delivery receipt and invoice
C_person_ROLE_INSPECTOR -> E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN : write: Delivery inspected and accepted: the obligation is due and…
C_person_ROLE_INSPECTOR -> N_UNIT_NGA_ACC : F067 Copy of the acceptance report, with the purchase order and…
== SP-08 Record the payable ==
ROLE_ACCOUNTANT -> B_SP_08 : Paper form: journal entry voucher
B_SP_08 -> C_person_ROLE_ACCOUNTANT : Record the payable
C_person_ROLE_ACCOUNTANT -> E_SYS_AGENCY_OWN : write: Payable recorded in the books (JEV: asset or expense, Accou…
C_person_ROLE_ACCOUNTANT -> N_UNIT_NGA_BUD : F069 JEV of the payable, at the budget unit for part C
== SP-08B Post the payable in part C of the ORS ==
